{"tool_name":"colorlab","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>COLORLAB is a component for processing, representing and reproducing color in a MATLAB environment. Among others, some of the functionalities it makes able to: -Represent the color content of any image in chromatic diagrams and tristimulus spaces in any system of primaries. -Compute advanced color descriptions of any image using several color appearance models (CIELab, CIEluv, ATD, Rlab, LLab, SVF and CIECAM). An userguide is provided.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>COLORLAB is a component for processing, representing and reproducing color in a MATLAB environment. Among others, some of the functionalities it makes able to: -Represent the color content of any image in chromatic diagrams and tristimulus spaces in any system of primaries. -Compute advanced color descriptions of any image using several color appearance models (CIELab, CIEluv, ATD, Rlab, LLab, SVF and CIECAM). An userguide is provided.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-18T16:15:54+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-02-13T15:39:27+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505227374,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Jes\u00fas Malo"},{"value":"Maria Jos\u00e9 Luque"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"https://isp.uv.es/code/visioncolor/colorlab.html#download"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":175,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"3750f9fc-5ff9-4411-8990-b3e992f13b8d","url":"/user/175"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4053,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image_processing","url":"/image-processing"}],"has